The web interface is built on Z-Dash
(https://github.com/saschazesiger/Z-Dash), vendored in
web/vendor/z-dash/ under its own licences: see
web/vendor/z-dash/LICENSE (MIT; Google Sans under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1; icon shapes from Lucide, ISC, and Feather, MIT).

The container image is based on the official llama.cpp image
(https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT) and the NVIDIA CUDA runtime
(NVIDIA Deep Learning Container License); it bundles llama.cpp's conversion
scripts (MIT).
